docs {
  # Partner Onboarding API

  Functional smoke tests for `onboarding-server`. Run them in order (the requests are numbered):
  request 03 onboards a partner with a random name and later requests use its id, so the collection is
  repeatable against the same server. Requests marked "demo" need the demo data and are skipped when
  the environment sets `demoData: false`.
}
